    },
    {
      "id": "claim_12193dcd8df64607aa0861a1cf9e0f6b",
      "statement": "In native mode the access_token is held only in the Java heap as the volatile static field PixivApiCore.accessToken and is never returned to JavaScript; PictelioApi.request receives only method/path/body and PixivApiCore.executeRequest injects Authorization, Referer, User-Agent, and optional Accept-Language headers, while PictelioAuth.loginWithRefreshToken returns user info and a rotated refresh token but not the access_token.",
      "evidence": [
