    {
      "id": "claim_6ef7ec674f6b4d85ad2f9d3ad0b7a6bd",
      "statement": "The app-lynx client supports only the OAuth refresh_token grant: auth.ts's single oauthTokenRequest helper builds the SparkMD5 X-Client-Time/X-Client-Hash signature and client credentials, and native mode delegates to PictelioAuth.loginWithRefreshToken → PixivApiCore.oauthTokenExchange, which writes the access_token into the Java heap; there is no PKCE flow in this client (login is by pasted refresh token).",
      "evidence": [
