      "id": "claim_a2b7b7e71620427fb5efa6c121adc79c",
      "statement": "refresh_token persistence goes through utils/tokenStorage.ts as a dual-path wrapper (IndexedDB in the web-core worker, NativeModules.PictelioSecureStorage Keystore on native), with unquoteNativeString correcting Lynx's JSON-quoted callback strings; authStore.restoreToken dedups concurrent restores via _restoreInFlight, and every login/refresh plus any Java-side rotated token is written back through saveRefreshToken without blocking in-memory state on persistence failure.",
