    {
      "id": "claim_4799f3cf1cae47abb0c8106635657278",
      "statement": "429 rate-limit backoff (ADR-0199) wraps execute/executeRaw inside the outer 401 retry: runWithRateLimitBackoff retries only ApiErrorType.RATE_LIMIT using capped exponential backoff with full jitter (default baseDelay 1000ms, maxDelay 30000ms, maxRetries 3), is abortable during the wait, attaches params.attempts on exhaustion, and its config is injected via setRateLimitBackoffConfig so the client does not depend on Pinia.",
